:false,\&quot;unique\&quot;:false,\&quot;persistent\&quot;:false,\&quot;hidden\&quot;:false,\&quot;clearOnHide\&quot;:false,\&quot;refreshOn\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;redrawOn\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;modalEdit\&quot;:false,\&quot;dataGridLabel\&quot;:false,\&quot;labelPosition\&quot;:\&quot;top\&quot;,\&quot;description\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;errorLabel\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;tooltip\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;hideLabel\&quot;:false,\&quot;tabindex\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;disabled\&quot;:false,\&quot;autofocus\&quot;:false,\&quot;dbIndex\&quot;:false,\&quot;customDefaultValue\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;calculateValue\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;calculateServer\&quot;:false,\&quot;widget\&quot;:null,\&quot;attributes\&quot;:{},\&quot;validateOn\&quot;:\&quot;change\&quot;,\&quot;validate\&quot;:{\&quot;required\&quot;:false,\&quot;custom\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;customPrivate\&quot;:false,\&quot;strictDateValidation\&quot;:false,\&quot;multiple\&quot;:false,\&quot;unique\&quot;:false},\&quot;conditional\&quot;:{\&quot;show\&quot;:null,\&quot;when\&quot;:null,\&quot;eq\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;},\&quot;overlay\&quot;:{\&quot;style\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;left\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;top\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;width\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;height\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;},\&quot;allowCalculateOverride\&quot;:false,\&quot;encrypted\&quot;:false,\&quot;showCharCount\&quot;:false,\&quot;showWordCount\&quot;:false,\&quot;properties\&quot;:{},\&quot;allowMultipleMasks\&quot;:false,\&quot;addons\&quot;:[],\&quot;tree\&quot;:false,\&quot;lazyLoad\&quot;:false,\&quot;autoAdjust\&quot;:false,\&quot;id\&quot;:\&quot;e7ohkn6\&quot;}],\&quot;placeholder\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;prefix\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;customClass\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;suffix\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;multiple\&quot;:false,\&quot;defaultValue\&quot;:null,\&quot;protected\&quot;:false,\&quot;unique\&quot;:false,\&quot;persistent\&quot;:false,\&quot;hidden\&quot;:false,\&quot;clearOnHide\&quot;:false,\&quot;refreshOn\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;redrawOn\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;modalEdit\&quot;:false,\&quot;dataGridLabel\&quot;:false,\&quot;labelPosition\&quot;:\&quot;top\&quot;,\&quot;description\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;errorLabel\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;tooltip\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;hideLabel\&quot;:false,\&quot;tabindex\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;disabled\&quot;:false,\&quot;autofocus\&quot;:false,\&quot;dbIndex\&quot;:false,\&quot;customDefaultValue\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;calculateValue\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;calculateServer\&quot;:false,\&quot;widget\&quot;:null,\&quot;attributes\&quot;:{},\&quot;validateOn\&quot;:\&quot;change\&quot;,\&quot;validate\&quot;:{\&quot;required\&quot;:false,\&quot;custom\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;customPrivate\&quot;:false,\&quot;strictDateValidation\&quot;:false,\&quot;multiple\&quot;:false,\&quot;unique\&quot;:false},\&quot;conditional\&quot;:{\&quot;show\&quot;:null,\&quot;when\&quot;:null,\&quot;eq\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;},\&quot;overlay\&quot;:{\&quot;style\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;left\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;top\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;width\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;height\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;},\&quot;allowCalculateOverride\&quot;:false,\&quot;encrypted\&quot;:false,\&quot;showCharCount\&quot;:false,\&quot;showWordCount\&quot;:false,\&quot;properties\&quot;:{},\&quot;allowMultipleMasks\&quot;:false,\&quot;addons\&quot;:[],\&quot;tree\&quot;:false,\&quot;lazyLoad\&quot;:false,\&quot;theme\&quot;:\&quot;default\&quot;,\&quot;breadcrumb\&quot;:\&quot;default\&quot;,\&quot;id\&quot;:\&quot;ef54own\&quot;},{\&quot;title\&quot;:\&quot;&lt;b>Confidentiality Agreement &lt;/b>  Acuerdo de confidencialidad del cliente\&quot;,\&quot;collapsible\&quot;:true,\&quot;key\&quot;:\&quot;Confidentiality_Agreement___Acuerdo_de_confidencialidad_del_cliente\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;panel\&quot;,\&quot;label\&quot;:\&quot;Panel\&quot;,\&quot;collapsed\&quot;:true,\&quot;input\&quot;:false,\&quot;tableView\&quot;:false,\&quot;components\&quot;:[{\&quot;html\&quot;:\&quot;&lt;p>All information shared in the client-provider setting will be kept private and confidential. If either party feels as though information should be shared in an effort to make appropriate referrals for services, you will be asked to sign a release form. The sharing of this information will enable agencies to effectively work together as a team in order to better assist you and your family.&lt;/p>&lt;p>Please know, however, specific confidential information can be shared without a release form in the following circumstances:&lt;br>&lt;strong>(a)&lt;/strong> When there is the risk of potential harm to the client’s self or to others.&lt;br>&lt;strong>(b) &lt;/strong>When there is an instance of suspected abuse of a child or elderly adult.&lt;/p>&lt;p>WRIC Individuals have the right and responsibility to:&lt;br>&lt;strong>(a)&lt;/strong> Competent, quality services free from discrimination based on race, color, religion, ethnic or national background, age, gender, physical or mental disability, health, and/or sexual orientation.&lt;br>&lt;strong>(b)&lt;/strong> Know how to voice a concern about your service, receive a response, and have access to the program grievance policy and program director information.&lt;/p>&lt;p>I understand that all the information will be handled confidentially in accordance with what is stated above.&lt;/p>&lt;p>Toda la información compartida en el entorno cliente-proveedor se mantendrá privada y confidencial. Si alguna de las partes siente que la información debe compartirse en un esfuerzo por hacer referencias apropiadas para los servicios, se le pedirá que firme un formulario de divulgación. Compartir esta información permitirá que las agencias trabajen juntas de manera efectiva como un equipo para brindarle una mejor asistencia a usted y a su familia.&lt;/p>&lt;p>Sin embargo, tenga en cuenta que la información confidencial específica se puede compartir sin un formulario de divulgación en las siguientes circunstancias:&lt;br>&lt;strong>(a)&lt;/strong> Cuando existe el riesgo de daño potencial para el cliente o para otros.&lt;br>&lt;strong>(b)&lt;/strong> Cuando hay un caso de sospecha de abuso de un niño o adulto mayor.&lt;/p>&lt;p>Las personas de WRIC tienen el derecho y la responsabilidad de:&lt;br>&lt;strong>(a)&lt;/strong> Servicios competentes y de calidad libres de discriminación basada en raza, color, religión, origen étnico o nacional, edad, género, discapacidad física o mental, salud o orientación sexual.&lt;br>&lt;strong>(b)&lt;/strong> Saber cómo expresar una inquietud sobre su servicio, recibir una respuesta y tener acceso a la política de quejas del programa y la información del director del programa.&lt;/p>&lt;p>Entiendo que toda la información será manejada de manera confidencial de acuerdo a lo expuesto anteriormente.&lt;/p>\&quot;,\&quot;label\&quot;:\&quot;Content\&quot;,\&quot;refreshOnChange\&quot;:false,\&quot;key\&quot;:\&quot;Content3\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;content\&quot;,\&quot;input\&quot;:false,\&quot;tableView\&quot;:false,\&quot;placeholder\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;prefix\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;customClass\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;suffix\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;multiple\&quot;:false,\&quot;defaultValue\&quot;:null,\&quot;protected\&quot;:false,\&quot;unique\&quot;:false,\&quot;persistent\&quot;:true,\&quot;hidden\&quot;:false,\&quot;clearOnHide\&quot;:true,\&quot;refreshOn\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;redrawOn\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;modalEdit\&quot;:false,\&quot;dataGridLabel\&quot;:false,\&quot;labelPosition\&quot;:\&quot;top\&quot;,\&quot;description\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;errorLabel\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;tooltip\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;hideLabel\&quot;:false,\&quot;tabindex\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;disabled\&quot;:false,\&quot;autofocus\&quot;:false,\&quot;dbIndex\&quot;:false,\&quot;customDefaultValue\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;calculateValue\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;calculateServer\&quot;:false,\&quot;widget\&quot;:null,\&quot;attributes\&quot;:{},\&quot;validateOn\&quot;:\&quot;change\&quot;,\&quot;validate\&quot;:{\&quot;required\&quot;:false,\&quot;custom\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;customPrivate\&quot;:false,\&quot;strictDateValidation\&quot;:false,\&quot;multiple\&quot;:false,\&quot;unique\&quot;:false},\&quot;conditional\&quot;:{\&quot;show\&quot;:null,\&quot;when\&quot;:null,\&quot;eq\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;},\&quot;overlay\&quot;:{\&quot;style\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;left\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;top\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;width\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;height\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;},\&quot;allowCalculateOverride\&quot;:false,\&quot;encrypted\&quot;:false,\&quot;showCharCount\&quot;:false,\&quot;showWordCount\&quot;:false,\&quot;properties\&quot;:{},\&quot;allowMultipleMasks\&quot;:false,\&quot;addons\&quot;:[],\&quot;id\&quot;:\&quot;ehk436b\&quot;},{\&quot;label\&quot;:\&quot;&lt;b> Please type First and Last Name to confirm your understanding that all the information will be handled confidentially in accordance with what is stated above &lt;/b> &lt;br> Por favor, escriba nombre y apellido para confirmar su comprensión de que toda la información será tratada de manera confidencial de acuerdo con lo que se ha expuesto anteriormente\&quot;,\&quot;tableView\&quot;:true,\&quot;validate\&quot;:{\&quot;required\&quot;:true,\&quot;custom\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;customPrivate\&quot;:false,\&quot;strictDateValidation\&quot;:false,\&quot;multiple\&quot;:false,\&quot;unique\&quot;:false,\&quot;minLength\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;maxLength\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;pattern\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;},\&quot;key\&quot;:\&quot;b_Please_type_First_and_Last_Name_to_confirm_your_understanding_that_all_the_information_will_be_handled_\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;textfield\&quot;,\&quot;input\&quot;:true,\&quot;placeholder\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;prefix\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;customClass\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;suffix\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;multiple\&quot;:false,\&quot;defaultValue\&quot;:null,\&quot;protected\&quot;:false,\&quot;unique\&quot;:false,\&quot;persistent\&quot;:true,\&quot;hidden\&quot;:false,\&quot;clearOnHide\&quot;:true,\&quot;refreshOn\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;redrawOn\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;modalEdit\&quot;:false,\&quot;dataGridLabel\&quot;:false,\&quot;labelPosition\&quot;:\&quot;top\&quot;,\&quot;description\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;errorLabel\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;tooltip\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;hideLabel\&quot;:false,\&quot;tabindex\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;disabled\&quot;:false,\&quot;autofocus\&quot;:false,\&quot;dbIndex\&quot;:false,\&quot;customDefaultValue\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;calculateValue\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;calculateServer\&quot;:false,\&quot;widget\&quot;:{\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;input\&quot;},\&quot;attributes\&quot;:{},\&quot;validateOn\&quot;:\&quot;change\&quot;,\&quot;conditional\&quot;:{\&quot;show\&quot;:null,\&quot;when\&quot;:null,\&quot;eq\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;},\&quot;overlay\&quot;:{\&quot;style\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;left\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;top\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;width\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;height\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;},\&quot;allowCalculateOverride\&quot;:false,\&quot;encrypted\&quot;:false,\&quot;showCharCount\&quot;:false,\&quot;showWordCount\&quot;:false,\&quot;properties\&quot;:{},\&quot;allowMultipleMasks\&quot;:false,\&quot;addons\&quot;:[],\&quot;mask\&quot;:false,\&quot;inputType\&quot;:\&quot;text\&quot;,\&quot;inputFormat\&quot;:\&quot;plain\&quot;,\&quot;inputMask\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;displayMask\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;spellcheck\&quot;:true,\&quot;truncateMultipleSpaces\&quot;:false,\&quot;id\&quot;:\&quot;ejhjhbs\&quot;}],\&quot;placeholder\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;prefix\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;customClass\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;suffix\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;multiple\&quot;:false,\&quot;defaultValue\&quot;:null,\&quot;protected\&quot;:false,\&quot;unique\&quot;:false,\&quot;persistent\&quot;:false,\&quot;hidden\&quot;:false,\&quot;clearOnHide\&quot;:false,\&quot;refreshOn\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;redrawOn\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;modalEdit\&quot;:false,\&quot;dataGridLabel\&quot;:false,\&quot;labelPosition\&quot;:\&quot;top\&quot;,\&quot;description\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;errorLabel\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;tooltip\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;hideLabel\&quot;:false,\&quot;tabindex\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;disabled\&quot;:false,\&quot;autofocus\&quot;:false,\&quot;dbIndex\&quot;:false,\&quot;customDefaultValue\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;calculateValue\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;calculateServer\&quot;:false,\&quot;widget\&quot;:null,\&quot;attributes\&quot;:{},\&quot;validateOn\&quot;:\&quot;change\&quot;,\&quot;validate\&quot;:{\&quot;required\&quot;:false,\&quot;custom\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;customPrivate\&quot;:false,\&quot;strictDateValidation\&quot;:false,\&quot;multiple\&quot;:false,\&quot;unique\&quot;:false},\&quot;conditional\&quot;:{\&quot;show\&quot;:null,\&quot;when\&quot;:null,\&quot;eq\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;},\&quot;overlay\&quot;:{\&quot;style\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;left\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;top\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;width\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;height\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;},\&quot;allowCalculateOverride\&quot;:false,\&quot;encrypted\&quot;:false,\&quot;showCharCount\&quot;:false,\&quot;showWordCount\&quot;:false,\&quot;properties\&quot;:{},\&quot;allowMultipleMasks\&quot;:false,\&quot;addons\&quot;:[],\&quot;tree\&quot;:false,\&quot;lazyLoad\&quot;:false,\&quot;theme\&quot;:\&quot;default\&quot;,\&quot;breadcrumb\&quot;:\&quot;default\&quot;,\&quot;id\&quot;:\&quot;elpjb96\&quot;},{\&quot;title\&quot;:\&quot;&lt;b>Grievance Policy &lt;/b> Política de quejas\&quot;,\&quot;collapsible\&quot;:true,\&quot;key\&quot;:\&quot;Grievance_Policy__Poltica_de_quejas\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;panel\&quot;,\&quot;label\&quot;:\&quot;Panel\&quot;,\&quot;collapsed\&quot;:true,\&quot;input\&quot;:false,\&quot;tableView\&quot;:false,\&quot;components\&quot;:[{\&quot;html\&quot;:\&quot;&lt;p>Women’s Rights Information Center encourages all staff, students, volunteers, and clients to respect each other, be sensitive to each other&#39;s needs, and to communicate directly if conflict arises. We encourage each person to offer constructive criticism and suggestions for improvement.&lt;/p>&lt;p>Additionally, Women’s Rights Information Center has established a system to resolve complaints quickly and fairly in order to devote maximum time, resources, and energy to our mission. This system is intended to enhance communication, improve working conditions and relationships, and to resolve differences in a confidential, non-adversarial setting. Any person who uses the established procedures can be assured that he or she will not be subjected to discriminatory or retaliatory action or penalized in any way.&lt;/p>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Procedure:&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>&lt;ol>&lt;li>If possible, discuss the problem with your Counselor, Instructor, or immediate supervisor.&lt;/li>&lt;li>If this person is part of the problem, the concern/grievance should be presented verbally or in writing to the Executive Director.&lt;/li>&lt;li>The Executive Director will respond to the individual’s concerns immediately if possible, or within five (5) days of receiving the grievance. The response will either provide a determination, solution, or a strategy for how the issue will be addressed.&lt;/li>&lt;li>If this step does not result in a satisfactory solution, or if this person is part of the problem, the grievance may be submitted in writing to the Board of Trustees.&lt;/li>&lt;li>The Board of Trustees will review all previous reports, meet with all interested parties, and make a final decision with respect to the grievance. The individual(s) shall be notified, in writing, of a determination, solution, or a strategy for how the issue will be resolved and reasons for the decision within a reasonable amount of time after the next scheduled Board meeting.&lt;br>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>&lt;/ol>&lt;p>El Centro de información sobre los derechos de las mujeres alienta a todo el personal, estudiantes, voluntarias y clientes a respetarse mutuamente, ser sensibles a las necesidades de los demás y comunicarse directamente si surge un conflicto. Alentamos a cada persona a ofrecer críticas constructivas y sugerencias de mejora.&lt;/p>&lt;p>Además, el Centro de información sobre los derechos de la mujer ha establecido un sistema para resolver quejas de manera rápida y justa a fin de dedicar el máximo tiempo, recursos y energía a nuestra misión. Este sistema está destinado a mejorar la comunicación, mejorar las condiciones de trabajo y las relaciones, resolver las diferencias en un entorno confidencial y no contencioso. Cualquier persona que utilice los procedimientos establecidos puede estar segura de que no será sometida a acciones discriminatorias o de represalia, ni será penalizada de ninguna manera.&lt;/p>&lt;p>&lt;strong>Procedimiento:&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>&lt;ol>&lt;li>Si es posible, discuta el problema con su consejero, instructor o supervisor inmediato.&lt;/li>&lt;li>Si esta persona es parte del problema, la inquietud/queja debe presentarse verbalmente o por escrito al Director Ejecutivo.&lt;/li>&lt;li>El Director Ejecutivo responderá a las inquietudes de la persona de inmediato si es posible, o dentro de los cinco (5) días posteriores a la recepción de la queja. La respuesta proporcionará una determinación, solución o una estrategia sobre cómo se abordará el problema.&lt;/li>&lt;li>Si este paso no resulta en una solución satisfactoria, o si esta persona es parte del problema, la queja puede presentarse por escrito a la Junta de Síndicos.&lt;/li>&lt;li>La Junta de Síndicos revisará todos los informes anteriores, se reunirá con todas las partes interesadas y tomará una decisión final con respecto a la queja. Las personas serán notificadas, por escrito, de una determinación, solución o estrategia sobre cómo se resolverá el problema y los motivos de la decisión dentro de un período de tiempo razonable después de la próxima reunión programada de la Junta.&lt;/li>&lt;/ol>\&quot;,\&quot;label\&quot;:\&quot;Content\&quot;,\&quot;refreshOnChange\&quot;:false,\&quot;key\&quot;:\&quot;Content4\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;content\&quot;,\&quot;input\&quot;:false,\&quot;tableView\&quot;:false,\&quot;placeholder\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;prefix\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;customClass\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;suffix\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;multiple\&quot;:false,\&quot;defaultValue\&quot;:null,\&quot;protected\&quot;:false,\&quot;unique\&quot;:false,\&quot;persistent\&quot;:true,\&quot;hidden\&quot;:false,\&quot;clearOnHide\&quot;:true,\&quot;refreshOn\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;redrawOn\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;modalEdit\&quot;:false,\&quot;dataGridLabel\&quot;:false,\&quot;labelPosition\&quot;:\&quot;top\&quot;,\&quot;description\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;errorLabel\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;tooltip\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;hideLabel\&quot;:false,\&quot;tabindex\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;disabled\&quot;:false,\&quot;autofocus\&quot;:false,\&quot;dbIndex\&quot;:false,\&quot;customDefaultValue\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;calculateValue\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;calculateServer\&quot;:false,\&quot;widget\&quot;:null,\&quot;attributes\&quot;:{},\&quot;validateOn\&quot;:\&quot;change\&quot;,\&quot;validate\&quot;:{\&quot;required\&quot;:false,\&quot;custom\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;customPrivate\&quot;:false,\&quot;strictDateValidation\&quot;:false,\&quot;multiple\&quot;:false,\&quot;unique\&quot;:false},\&quot;conditional\&quot;:{\&quot;show\&quot;:null,\&quot;when\&quot;:null,\&quot;eq\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;},\&quot;overlay\&quot;:{\&quot;style\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;left\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;top\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;width\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;height\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;},\&quot;allowCalculateOverride\&quot;:false,\&quot;encrypted\&quot;:false,\&quot;showCharCount\&quot;:false,\&quot;showWordCount\&quot;:false,\&quot;properties\&quot;:{},\&quot;allowMultipleMasks\&quot;:false,\&quot;addons\&quot;:[],\&quot;id\&quot;:\&quot;e4yizfa\&quot;},{\&quot;label\&quot;:\&quot;&lt;b> By printing your First and Last Name here, you acknowledge and understand the Women’s Rights Information Center Grievance Policy.  Print your First and Last Name below. &lt;/b> &lt;br> Al escribir su nombre y apellido aquí, usted reconoce y comprende la política de quejas del Centro de Información de Derechos de la Mujer. Escriba su nombre y apellido a continuación.\&quot;,\&quot;tableView\&quot;:true,\&quot;validate\&quot;:{\&quot;required\&quot;:true,\&quot;custom\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;customPrivate\&quot;:false,\&quot;strictDateValidation\&quot;:false,\&quot;multiple\&quot;:false,\&quot;unique\&quot;:false,\&quot;minLength\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;maxLength\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;pattern\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;},\&quot;key\&quot;:\&quot;By_printing_your_First_and_Last_Name_here_you_acknowledge_and_understand_the_Women_s_Rights_Information_Cent\&quot;,\&quot;type\&quot;:\&quot;textfield\&quot;,\&quot;input\&quot;:true,\&quot;placeholder\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;prefix\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;customClass\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;suffix\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;multiple\&quot;:false,\&quot;defaultValue\&quot;:null,\&quot;protected\&quot;:false,\&quot;unique\&quot;:false,\&quot;persistent\&quot;:true,\&quot;hidden\&quot;:false,\&quot;clearOnHide\&quot;:true,\&quot;refreshOn\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;redrawOn\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;modalEdit\&quot;:false,\&quot;dataGridLabel\&quot;:false,\&quo